      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "i think this physbone behaviour also makes it difficult to make interaction with them looking smooth and soft if you only have a couple bones for a component. With dynamic bones i was able to make that interacting with them looked soft and it felt like i could push them freely and smoothly in every direction. while with phybones it feels more like a clunky stiff chain that shoves itself around in weird angles if you only use a few bones.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
