  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I feel PhysBone Collider is weaker than DynamicBone's.\nTest Video: https://twitter.com/xlwnya/status/1501064770090196994\nPhysBone colliders behave weak under following conditions.\n* Sparse bones\n* with MaxAngle\n* moving fast\nNo MaxAngle (MaxAngle=180): https://twitter.com/xlwnya/status/1501080244945448960\nStill feels a bit weak.\nDynamicBone: https://twitter.com/xlwnya/status/1501080766825988100\nBone angle is bad. But collider works well.",
